@Nugget_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@ApiKey = dev-api-key

### Service index
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/v3/index.json

### Upload a package (raw body, like curl --data-binary)
PUT {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/package
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./newtonsoft.json.13.0.3.nupkg

### Versions of a package (flat container)
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/v3-flatcontainer/newtonsoft.json/index.json

### Package metadata (registration)
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/v3/registration5-gz-semver2/newtonsoft.json/index.json

### Search
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/query?q=json&prerelease=true&semVerLevel=2.0.0&take=10

### Autocomplete
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/autocomplete?q=newtonsoft

### Unlist
DELETE {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/package/Newtonsoft.Json/13.0.3
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}

### Relist
POST {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/package/Newtonsoft.Json/13.0.3
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}

### Delete for good
DELETE {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/package/Newtonsoft.Json/13.0.3?purge=true
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}

### Upload vulnerability data (from https://api.nuget.org/v3/vulnerabilities/index.json)
PUT {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/vulnerabilities/base
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./vulnerability.base.json

### Rebuild the catalog from S3
POST {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/api/v2/admin/rebuild
X-NuGet-ApiKey: {{ApiKey}}

### Readiness
GET {{Nugget_HostAddress}}/health/ready
